# the battery at the header's right (plat_battery): three bars, rust at one or none, a bolt on USB power, nothing
# until it is read; a screen reader hears it at the end of the page's summary (WHERE)
wait 300
expect battery 3
shot full.png
battery 2
wait 100
shot two.png
battery 1
wait 100
shot one.png
battery 0
wait 100
shot low.png
battery 4
wait 100
shot usb.png
battery -1
wait 100
shot unread.png
# the Setup page, with the CPU beside it
battery 2
tap GLO
wait 300
shot setup.png
listen
wait 100
said Battery two thirds
battery 4
where
said On USB power
battery -1
where
unsaid Battery
unsaid USB
battery off
expect battery 3
